# Upstream SHA-256 checksums for the pinned Node runtime.
#
# Copied verbatim from https://nodejs.org/dist/v22.11.0/SHASUMS256.txt.
# scripts/stage-release.sh verifies every Node archive it stages against these
# values, so a tampered mirror or a truncated download can never reach a
# machine — and install.sh then re-verifies against the manifest generated from
# these same bytes.
#
# Bumping Node: change every line here to the new version's upstream checksums
# AND the NODE_VERSION default in install.sh (a test asserts they agree).
